Hello All,

Attached is a comparison of the 10" PE Ball Valve we offer (made by Polyval=
ve formerly Nordstrom), the Central Plastics/Georg Fischer valve, and the L=
yall/Polytec valve (private labeled to Integrity Fusion and CMF/Aquafuse.  =
CMF is known to sell the Central valve as well.

The comparisons are specific to the 10" size although a lot of the paramete=
rs would apply to all sizes.

The 10" valves compared are the fullest bore available from that maker.

Other manufacturers not included here are Kerotest and Broen.

John


--_000_9B7E2735CEC37E4D9137A9548F21D78372545FCA1DMAIL_
